{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1356,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:613e8818c36e427e433e9331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昨天晚上我和波旁做了糖霜饼干！\r\n送给你当作今天的点心喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a81a4fb77f5f9f3494a17a14690f739034714b05ef2fd2da66b51d33d4e0d15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dccc65759bbb636500c20cb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「叶绿体・蒸散」！\r\n我和小革把上课学到的东西\r\n编成咒语了……耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1cab9a445e2f5de43586db8af97e45d5d574e798566d5fc7dcf22efda82601f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0bd8ef6b35377d1eacf549b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "放学后，我偶尔会\r\n和摄辉一起野餐。\r\n因此记住了很多风的名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e3d3606a1d9c2b710d66a623e49e9d0652ff8829efda8eb2345cd562e7baea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbc71cfc0ac66800512e17f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你今天也辛苦了。\r\n你的努力我全都清楚地看在眼里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f1bfbbb124f1b5f335819ea8d2598f8ba56a6dea0867949a6e8bb4ac97c0518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cf7f8e196c4ad686b458657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个，可以请你教我怎么\r\n泡咖啡吗？原因是……\r\n明天早上或许你就知道了……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f5a2d3181afb4b572b8f5d165e8e93d411833a44c5720e994ddeff6068dd94f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f64e8dd8e10e33e22bfbb7ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "重炮非常有品味。\r\n心形花坛就是她的点子哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48db32b12b56b9bae38e108e0f743a5253ce5f40b2f138584c35c202c56ad49b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2622c79d278660137b0790fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也好热呢……\r\n如果能把头纱当作遮阳布就好了……\r\n但对训练员来说，可能太小块了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae146e87152b9b162da75af5f295048626b870221e1661398d0640720e3e7ccc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e531f564babb680c4c0152e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果粉红色有姐姐的话……\r\n应该就是红色了吧？……我想\r\n枫红色的婚纱一定也很漂亮呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc5f357858b8c28f8193efc2f1a2d7f0d83849228afd528591ba0109be3e1ad7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33ea39c750f3a19c804acbb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要喝一碗热汤呢？\r\n我加了很多姜，\r\n想说应该能让身心暖和起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "068fe5a71308cbd79ab31f231c6f838d91bab64018f05c72a92b6553c033ab72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90df8799f4c3d3cfa1cd3137",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8cffb7c6a2c2fb440def143",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed80515fc1fb8ec392d5d97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "她的内心跟青天一样明亮广阔，\r\n而且性格像云朵一样悠闲安适……\r\n所以只要在天空身旁就觉得很平静。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91353a24c32ae9e2773780d4b69a84a253ed3e7b6ce0c3204b2ee8ebbe9da73b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8366b33034910c5457884cab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "溪流是我的目标♪\r\n希望我有一天也能成为一个\r\n像她那样优秀的姐姐～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a8656014c9ea494031b542688b02439e37e328bcdda0f08030ab2effd9afb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aadd29ce468e0569e2d2e0d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "进王会津津有味地\r\n吃着我替她准备的东西，\r\n看了就会觉得很开心♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20c75cdbdedba8ec9e7e795d09c42cc48f1987d8ddac560ed40277dc82b9d764",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bc9d134a670a4c6ba71545e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我妈妈不太会做料理，\r\n让我有点担心……\r\n以前都是我在旁边帮忙……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e99e455ba11e589a6ec7522d9c09d9337d1657d9af0e8233c8cdaf4f4450c2e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9feb7454623885c4a399107",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我对丢沙包就有点自信……！\r\n我以前还曾在班上的丢沙包大赛中\r\n获得优胜呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c8076942bbd186161d1594c6335bf5be5ea7584e9172a6c28cd5e329941d3e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae5387c7e58661a0d48b006c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然唱歌和跳舞都还有待加强，\r\n但我会灌注许多心意！\r\n希望能够传达给观众。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9b7fa2c8b906d0c8d49b2e765079a53a9558cca8075ce6edc58423b48a9c5ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8f02782642c48c5ff4a450",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在舞台上看见的景色，\r\n就像有许多花朵绽放的花田……\r\n我偶尔会看得入迷呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eabb9e5807027733e45c42e36736183a41607de32b4ad1226ab2a20df55f92ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:475a630e24e8b447d6454796",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服的设计就像\r\n绽放的花苞……\r\n希望我也能以这种方式成长♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0fc4d5ae1b8cde2b05140ac60b5d678a86ee484409cf45dd5433e293ad40811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcc797612dfce53da93c81ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活泼的黄色搭配成熟的紫色……\r\n希望能让大家看见\r\n各种不同的我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5645df24afb56e3376af9227a989cd634ea0f4f332afbd25e5c20ed48d935b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33b0a2f953d3723325c94813",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请你工作加油喔。\r\n我也会努力上课！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5651f010e67665cbc6342fde1e79149a6526741f1e6b8a45348077ee33260704",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0a7e7412b0942caa79142c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我今天挑战了角色便当！\r\n做出了可爱的公主战士呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9188f2c640a39fc5ead0afc4c7ce53f773f1ebfafb06561298e3b0b3e0b7383",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dfa819aec81243dafe80554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回去后要预习和复习……\r\n另外还要记得替配菜备料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4e4cf249ac14db991b6d65b267e7c21c9966694a634eb0619914d53d2f8f134",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9537c9220ba9813857ec05d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "林荫道的樱花树都开花了。\r\n我最近很期待上下学的时间呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "51a66c77d883bd1291e92a6c3b45d792d17187aa2fcd6101443380a71ef00dcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59bf285e50796e14cdd8a423",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和太阳她们一起放烟火，\r\n真的很开心呢♪这时候是不是\r\n要说……「感觉好嗨啊」？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3a544857ddf75484c693d136a70cc8eb9743ce7d24b2cf085297d0b9200bc0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db4176e8db3902c7949ae743",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天的枫叶非常漂亮，\r\n但我也很推荐波斯菊和大丽花\r\n等漂亮的花朵喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "70290cea27f4f1dcc05c27b9a10ee4f9974a5101f49780f2de1ed26a9014e83b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c78668ebc88c7b319d2f68c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啾！……啊，不好意思！\r\n我明明有多穿几件衣服……\r\n但果然还是会觉得冷呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c993b777e1850f7952ac93682cb2c4b21ba65774cfc1eec564b875b4ed3c90c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81792749dd9b7b1079edba94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……天空的尾巴好像偶尔会\r\n下意识地绕着我的尾巴……\r\n我是不是该告诉她比较好呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "633a82a0233320c2e422578732939a2c4f7ddefced1e7ff1bbd1faaa5ae814e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9072d798c26e57e6075379c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "速子问我对于让花儿永不枯萎的\r\n研究有没有兴趣……\r\n我有点好奇……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbffbd68d4ba3cb9c0d89c96cc785201d0c71f2459384a144e4ddcb3cbc77320",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d36daba045d9ea36b310afe6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大树前辈一直在称赞我的婚纱……\r\n可是把我抱起来转圈圈……\r\n实在让我很害羞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faf690ac4307e7167c1167bffe3d56bad3c400718729b29fbd46f350273ad01d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42e0c65f1edf85703b1d035c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "菱亚马逊穿婚纱的模样好漂亮……\r\n童话里的公主是不是就像那样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7ef1f6d48df8a70dd91c7aab31b43a7f29da0b605c0c073524cd5a351dff329",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f46465f81e92fc42fd59224b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小女组不……小妮组……呜呜……\r\n好！小女子不才，还请多多指教！\r\n……讲对了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c2c76fccbb7a76466532b4ec24b7c58161791102aeccaf6f9f0d7299d396e79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61a4f32eebf354d959c1b287",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "换好衣服后，我会先在镜子前面\r\n转一圈。这样就能带着开朗的心情\r\n度过愉快的一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63be94177cdd458267b8bba9a9fac7a6d8f68bc69367248e47b9cb4d37a9b5b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2650ccebe3d8a7549d654e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚我跟气槽一起整理花坛。\r\n还一起唱希望花儿快快长大的歌♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "09a8e0990fdea61199f9605c58463c5e6ce6d044fdfdf46d561edd38e7d19bfa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a16e03f0999d016fe5819d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得在放假前烫好衣服才行。\r\n训练员，如果你也有什么衣物要烫，\r\n就让我帮忙一起烫吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff3207a2da3c01f23cc2871599782c744d34085a86322aa66be5a9268b40c1ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b7ba95698cd5b3e631e55fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裙子上的蒲公英，\r\n灵感好像是来自和朋友聊天时的我。\r\n会是跟谁在一起的时候呢……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e583d97f8543fbc5d209f006728ae54e2e9b702261ca225475e766e346bbe3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0f8f07bba947ffdc94f6a07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你不觉得进王开朗无比又耀眼，\r\n给人的感觉就像是位\r\n如向日葵般的大姐姐吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a66a33433face8dba9405df11906cde256f83dc3b96211d6175b709abb75aef1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb6014525449bea61914ee0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有金木樨的香味！\r\n我想跟你一起去找\r\n味道是从哪里传来的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "52f71c311fa9fac86d1c7ec3e5c9fdcbd599aded1322e84f4e3afb63ddb3c64b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f1f6184789a1f5a78b9c6b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好想念花儿盛开的季节……\r\n……啊，你看我的裙子！\r\n上面开满了很多花哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4154a8342a1766e380925b7bf5ed5fceec908069a21032e691c84040d6e9a4fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aaa1e41f58cd48300ad363a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柔和的粉红色配上满满的花儿……\r\n有好多我最爱的元素。好像我自己\r\n变成了捧花似的……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3567805d831b67e929ad288f269a9f22c2e9f3419a17a74ffdae73700ba2edb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfba734b6d8b46896770dac2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把照片传给妈妈他们看，结果就\r\n立刻接到了电话……他们哭着说……\r\n我非常漂亮……呜呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3a0feae3a26c095d650bfbd6bad4b31d3a8dd5a7e4015f56f5c889a49c9693",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3cb3351123b38a5d6da5df3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我还不够成熟……\r\n但麻烦你替我训练了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e66897c5fa120554227fb1ddab297c0161c03ca779f426d5f08988267967f84c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:758dd29d55771d6f508d7c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "がんばりますっ……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2447b30214bac3df4a17f732b0f3496e602939ffd089c84062b3b22caced098b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c80281df6d57a2479be96d51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够确实地完成训练，\r\n才是成熟的姐姐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd768f078fc4eb2a8baee805fc3d8b98c245453a4cc87e4d98acf9ac150a4355",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cca11cf9610399393ef2771",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的内容我都预习过了！\r\n随时都能开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dfe4fe8b19e3611b42db63f78922e1470786f7f389902ebacdabe53f42cb710",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4ffc09c69766d7d696ba8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一点一点地努力才能积少成多。\r\n今天也要认真练跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db3ab44bf52b71ae8d94272b8eba3206b39246205a98e697acc70aae6fd2ee1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef4d3e39574aa5fca8075318",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是新的训练项目吗？\r\n我什么都想试试看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c45144b2b0c38d8c8851ff1e0daa24cd9aeafddf73d030c5fb73605fcc83749",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14b39ff87e90665bacb440f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了回报支持我的训练员，\r\n我要变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8343da1e1514cf4b80da57204e67aff03c431fcaac598b9f9b87389d199a4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7eaf40e076d3b5b9f2c3da4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想和训练员一起努力！\r\n这样我一定就能无止尽地跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11aa92c6a0d23140ba63f4fdaa09829a5077976d170e8efc0a42a8d3d8a2b4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24898c29b62bcf7136f1bfd7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要透过这次集训，\r\n变得像向日葵一样大！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88f7687c58d593a61a890d55dd5b8abec6cac7c487513319beae46ebf3f89e8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4525066a4ae0cfaa06913c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望自己配得上这身\r\n华丽的婚纱……\r\n所以今天也请你多多指教了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "189be10cd3f31ace8a28b527ef2f29b4d96a1ffffdcdcfb0113e2a796e220394",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be07053fa9b1b5094bf5f424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很擅长手洗衣服！\r\n所以你不用在意脏污没关系，\r\n我们尽量练习吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "89ab3e291d74fbccab76f0c222905c9cfe5d4f004a445a375dbaf12ea18ffb70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a505a9955dcec50cf581ece",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一跑步就会随风摇曳……\r\n好像公主一样，很漂亮♪\r\n啊，不可以看得这么入迷呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d095a49a2e17da97a4064fc85b1fdb7ba076ecb85e5099bf2bfa0586b210a3b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dccd116e478f7606c3016484",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔呵呵……呵呵呵……呵呵呵……\r\n……啊，我想在亮相圈让自己看起来\r\n更像是个大姐姐一点……很奇怪吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17af85250607e19d5db6ff19b0ebc117c59b6723fe5a6a0ee7a76059a21194c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f3079978cda158087afb76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然未来的事情很难说……\r\n但我相信，只要有远大的理想，\r\n最后一定可以绽放出笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "816cb605b88f4f14ed22536173c7c2fd630d8314e7f6f8ee148ea0310cc759fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52469f612ddc9be12c99783d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使步伐很小，但只要有\r\n训练员在一旁守护着我……\r\n就能抵达美好的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af1bcaf5061d12112543e545f2322a9291a5386ad9509acbad6765b3db7c0f50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e12e730a470aa3021d0cec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我发誓一定会好好听训练员的话，\r\n让观众们绽放出许多喜悦……\r\n那我们就开始吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c81fadbc00ce918515eee2631429f935eee03f448144c75830b891785ccaaa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135a7f5f19450c53fd702c24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你让我成功绽放了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d11acd7b4d1804e9e8439b7b6b827e5bca31c4915d008a618057327b5487ee7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffafacbe0c6987b789a4a19d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请你今后也要继续守护着我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bf6bf153ac07e4914cd045ff7949058a1c4c58a7610d6909f6b2237e52b0fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:525c432001a5aa13c33b5a40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今后的路我也要和你一起走……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e2a283ae9c1480fc62599854e9c41d36bfef94755ba28f181eb04c2c3294bb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aab38aa03f8b132d734ee7b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "顺利抵达终点了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6443ad35ddf8da44ef4506350205ef267e7b08a208a0427328d660b9d8868f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c14807748e6fe6b9b38fb06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要不断成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4080af3758b0b7782e29c2af1b958aba78f7ee99693ebe6c8c44394410285eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4de951adeab14458a2db910",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要绽放硕大的花朵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4f17ec1beebf581ed23dbfd7b1aaeb8fa2df15ac62be22c4c0039efe0b95aab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6568d4c3e7799f63d1c46a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是西野花！\r\n我会拼命努力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6d7212f456909fe8672a92226fbf41dc9fa13ec345be37541bde3bc5fffa289",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d8f072bab3c2da07527d0b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让爱与勇气乘着花瓣……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4944bd678bfe18be984bc19d3683b5b720210db960a66a4f87d6c0615db670f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dfb12d4991569cdbafcac98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够帮上忙我很开心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a74ee6f32cf25ad34615973de9147d167bc6a5511f9aa2e146b9748ecc3bf49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0289e1dc76e9c8e83dc7905f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也能帮上忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "33e6707092ec4bb3f5a4baa9bca8b0f2762c9d7a9a73636eef9fd7d08af2818d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95c7f2365b531eab13d73ac8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要变漂亮……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bccd35ed94d3db876390fdd2aaa368a3245c225f81ff57ebd51fcdfb6311172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47dc1747140b94c7525d3f13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我收到祝福了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4853d319d8287ca32ae04eb1dd8a656cd3ea7a4c65ba1bae4b70de16587ae51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89e5f415e3deaeaebc3fd7e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我发誓会和你一起拼命努力……\r\n绽放出漂亮的花朵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "81ea50a50260e54d5080604f608adab241ce173b8c0b1d50716bcf5950641c74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71daca2181ff5b9375dfc48c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是西野花。\r\n请你和我一起前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5fdc508ed5310a070b58459a7a8ac56642f396ef929ba9a91f8f915b29c0bee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1051",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2928168c22530c4060bfdefd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上咯──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca2a2ce423e0b297fc818e8169f4c42f597498205d359d90c942e499cf720ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c405a73604a5644a59265f1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "种田的老爷爷又送我胡萝卜了──\r\n等一下我再给你哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f795b85e370d0db64679a6503cd846f63189c65a4292a442cf0773af6f5173c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa0a559060b0768d026ade2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるねー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5909d5966d662bbeeadf02b80069857c1ac6c00936ee685cba354c7b7710c43a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1f9b3724b02e2e32e8a30c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "たっだいまー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c89c8d70ae3eaf654ea8e3f0f951fbb9203c612787ad1049a345d3c332463bd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64f1dc23b880552130634c93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会做到和训练员的约定的！\r\n我们一起拿下很多第一名吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e326de911605c2652596646f967a1d8e22daa2aa406c72b2cf61f0ba5b2187",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e12c130210b36efee649767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐～杂志的特辑内容你看了吗？\r\n说我是「带给大家勇气的赛马娘」呢！\r\n诶嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd18ee4da3efb5192476954d02aa94efc7f258a3f63fa2455066586d54568732",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c495695c0ddd29f423bb2c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也来玩羽毛毽吧──？\r\n脸变全黑很好玩哦──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "834f6604ea4c75ae2fbfdb9a36b96b351b68592ea3572ae09ada139874cd2b51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61ea69980250693291ed3af0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们大家一起做了巧克力哦──\r\n因为我是负责试吃的，\r\n所以吃了好多呢──♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d2c07560122cdee1ee6d240878814c2f15d9278d20e19077d0ca30a210beee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df70403577e5248db3ff91e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自从遇到训练员后，\r\n经历了好多有趣的事情哦！\r\n所以我买了很多巧克力要给你哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d4ecd46c87dd7bf1c53546792409d3ee360d3a252b811682cd8eea43d66c251",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1052",
        "10005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
